@startuml TemplateGeneration
title Template generation with model-directed checks
autonumber

actor User
participant Application as App
participant Domain
participant Model
participant MCP

User -> App: Generate template(domain, prompt, difficulty)
App -> Domain: Get generation specification
Domain --> App: Instructions + schema + allowed tool names

App -> MCP: Get definitions for allowed tools
MCP --> App: Tool descriptions and schemas
App -> Model: Generate proposal and recommend checks\n(prompt, difficulty, instructions, schema, tools)
Model --> App: Proposal + fixed check plan

loop Run checks (maximum 3 attempts)
    loop Each selected check
        Model --> App: Request check for current proposal
        App -> MCP: Run check
        MCP --> App: Pass/fail + validation evidence
        App --> Model: Validation evidence
    end

    alt All checks passed
        App -> App: Mark proposal as checked
        break Stop retrying
    else A check failed and attempts remain
        App -> Model: Revise proposal using validation evidence
        Model --> App: Revised proposal
    else A check failed on attempt 3
        App -> App: Mark proposal as needs_review
    end
end

alt All checks passed
    App -> Domain: Finalize proposal
    Domain --> App: Reviewable template
    App --> User: Template + validation evidence
    User -> App: Approve or reject
else Three attempts failed
    App --> User: Latest proposal + validation evidence + needs_review
end

@enduml
